Cc: linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org, linux-arch@vger.kernel.org, Benjamin Herrenschmidt <benh@kernel.crashing.org>, David Miller <davem@davemloft.net>, Hugh Dickins <hugh.dickins@tiscali.co.uk>, Mel Gorman <mel@csn.ul.ie>, Nick Piggin <npiggin@kernel.dk>, Peter Zijlstra <a.p.zijlstra@chello.nl>, Paul McKenney <paulmck@linux.vnet.ibm.com>, Yanmin Zhang <yanmin_zhang@linux.intel.com>, Stephen Rothwell <sfr@canb.auug.org.au>, Paul Mundt <lethal@linux-sh.org>
